        <segment id="1" parent="11" relname="preparation">You address an important issue.</segment>
        <segment id="2" parent="12" relname="nonvolitional-cause">As baby boomers continue to retire,</segment>
        <segment id="3" parent="12" relname="span">they respresent a large portion of users that is growing.</segment>
        <segment id="4" parent="5" relname="antithesis">However, despite a number of regulations that promotes usability for the elders and the disable,</segment>
